    "page": "transition-delay",
    "id": "stagger-sibling-elements",
    "title": "Stagger sibling elements",
    "html": [
      "<!-- One native trigger · two independent timelines -->\n<label class=\"block w(280) max-w-full font-sm\n              (transform:translateX(96px)):has(input:checked)>span>span@media(screen)\">\n  <input type=\"checkbox\" aria-label=\"Move both layers\"\n    class=\"mr-xs accent-blue\n           outline(2):focus-visible outline-solid:focus-visible outline-blue:focus-visible\n           outline-offset(3):focus-visible\">\n  Move both layers\n  <span aria-hidden=\"true\"\n    class=\"block mt-md p-xs outline(1) outline-dashed outline-line-subtle\">\n    <span id=\"first\"\n      class=\"grid (place-items:center) h(48) w(128)\n             b(1) b-solid b-blue-60 r-sm bg-blue-10\n             fg-blue-80 (transform:none)\n             (transition:none)@media(print)\n             (transition-property:transform)@media(screen)@motion-safe (transition-duration:var(--duration-slowest))@media(screen)@motion-safe (transition-timing-function:linear)@media(screen)@motion-safe\">\n      First · no delay\n    </span>\n    <span id=\"target\"\n      class=\"grid (place-items:center) h(48) w(128) mt-sm\n             b(1) b-solid b-violet-60 r-sm bg-violet-10\n             fg-violet-80 (transform:none)\n             (transition:none)@media(print)\n             (transition-property:transform)@media(screen)@motion-safe (transition-duration:var(--duration-slowest))@media(screen)@motion-safe (transition-timing-function:linear)@media(screen)@motion-safe\n             transition-delay-slow@media(screen)@motion-safe\">\n      Second · 300ms\n    </span>\n  </span>\n</label>"
    ],
